    <section id="overview" class="panel">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Dataset Overview & Historical Context</h2></div><p>The dataset is compact—one consolidated winner per ceremony year—but its shape tells a large institutional story: early studio-era recurrence, a mid-century composer canon, late-century diversification, and a contemporary return to concentrated repeat success.</p></div>
