          <p>Two caveats matter for interpretation. First, the dataset consolidates category history into one winner per year, even though Academy score categories have changed over time. Second, no <code>Era</code>, <code>Musical_Style</code>, birthdate, or age columns exist in the CSV, so stylistic and age-based claims are limited to what can be inferred from year, film title, and composer recurrence.</p>
